From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:10:29 +0000
Subject: feat(ohos): persist typed avatar image models in a native-backed
 cache

Adds a persisted, generation-checked avatar cache for "slock-avatar-cache-v1:"
image models. KRNetworkCacheUtil resolves these models through
KRAvatarCacheManager; decoded pixelmaps live in KRMemoryCacheModule with
promote/retain/retire/has NAPI entry points so a stale generation can never
replace a newer one. Includes ArkTS contract tests and a native model test.

Fork-Patch: ohos-avatar-cache
Origin: 1a5b41ac
Upstream-Status: not-upstreamable
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

